    "Maru can remind you again up to 2 times, 30 minutes apart, if you don’t record a dose." : {
      "comment" : "Alert after the first save of an item with a time: the one-line offer. It names the number of reminders and the time between them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
