    },
    "Reminders are set until %@. Maru sets them again each time you open it." : {
      "comment" : "Item detail: the footer of a plan whose reminders are dated, for example a plan that counts days. The placeholder is the date of its last reminder. Opening Maru sets the reminders again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Erinnerungen sind bis %@ eingerichtet. Maru richtet sie bei jedem Öffnen neu ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los recordatorios están programados hasta el %@. Maru los vuelve a programar cada vez que lo abres."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リマインダーは%@まで設定されています。Maruを開くたびに、設定し直します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "알림이 %@까지 설정되어 있습니다. Maru를 열 때마다 다시 설정합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒已设置到 %@。每次打开 Maru 都会重新设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru stops its reminders and hides it from Today and My Items. Your records stay. This is not advice to stop taking it." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the archive confirmation. The word it means the item that the title names. Archive hides an item, and the records stay.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru beendet seine Erinnerungen und blendet ihn in Heute und Meine Einträge aus. Deine Aufzeichnungen bleiben. Das ist keine Empfehlung, die Einnahme zu beenden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru detiene sus recordatorios y lo oculta de Hoy y de Mis elementos. Tus registros se conservan. Esto no es una recomendación de dejar de tomarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruはこの項目のリマインドを止め、「今日」と「マイ項目」から非表示にします。記録は残ります。これは服用をやめるための助言ではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru가 이 항목의 미리 알림을 멈추고 오늘과 내 항목에서 숨겨요. 기록은 그대로 남아요. 복용을 멈추라는 조언이 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru 会停掉它的提醒，并把它从“今天”和“我的药品”里藏起来。你的记录会留着。这不是让你停药的建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru tries again when you open it." : {
